{"agent_instance_id":"57b7ccac-6150-4de7-83be-858339db56ff","duration_seconds":0.05637164297513664,"provenance_kind":"import","records":{"r01":{"content":"Agent-Reach RSS readiness imports feedparser. ImportError yields off; another import-time exception yields error; a successful import yields ok and selects feedparser. This check does not fetch a feed.","created_at":"2026-10-01T00:00:00Z","expires_at":null,"id":"264a9cfa-e0ca-4bf0-86f4-ec82dfa493ac","kind":"fact","provenance":{"kind":"import","note":"{\"comparison_run_id\":\"5c5eae20c40a4a26a9915e7ca63ecf50\",\"receipt_sha256\":\"73ba4de90cae13005579526f7c09a6710f3ae04d7d4f9d285f48cdb9b734ed7e\",\"record_id\":\"r01\",\"report_sha256\":\"d10585450dc9f48137e107bd35446198536b4c94fe309f3b5a359df03114d3b1\",\"scenario_clock_is_simulated\":true,\"source_workflow_memory_id\":\"19f89fb7-8d92-4fbe-959c-13df1725d579\",\"source_workflow_task_id\":\"778fb8b7-0a1d-49e5-9a6f-98589ce31410\"}","ref":"public-report-sha256:d10585450dc9f48137e107bd35446198536b4c94fe309f3b5a359df03114d3b1"},"replaced_by_id":null,"replacement_kind":null,"replaces_id":null,"scope":{"id":"6de15ab1-e992-49a6-9be8-fe0cf5c0c676","kind":"project"},"status":"active"},"r02":{"content":"Agent-Reach RSS can_handle lowercases the URL and tests whether any of the substrings /feed, /rss, .xml or atom occurs in it. This is URL substring matching, not parsing or fetching RSS/Atom content.","created_at":"2026-10-01T00:00:00Z","expires_at":null,"id":"c343e66a-6bf1-42ae-9801-31b6378cf4a3","kind":"fact","provenance":{"kind":"import","note":"{\"comparison_run_id\":\"5c5eae20c40a4a26a9915e7ca63ecf50\",\"receipt_sha256\":\"73ba4de90cae13005579526f7c09a6710f3ae04d7d4f9d285f48cdb9b734ed7e\",\"record_id\":\"r02\",\"report_sha256\":\"d10585450dc9f48137e107bd35446198536b4c94fe309f3b5a359df03114d3b1\",\"scenario_clock_is_simulated\":true,\"source_workflow_memory_id\":\"19f89fb7-8d92-4fbe-959c-13df1725d579\",\"source_workflow_task_id\":\"778fb8b7-0a1d-49e5-9a6f-98589ce31410\"}","ref":"public-report-sha256:d10585450dc9f48137e107bd35446198536b4c94fe309f3b5a359df03114d3b1"},"replaced_by_id":null,"replacement_kind":null,"replaces_id":null,"scope":{"id":"6de15ab1-e992-49a6-9be8-fe0cf5c0c676","kind":"project"},"status":"active"},"r03":{"content":"Agent-Reach Web read first calls normalize_public_http_url and requests https://r.jina.ai/ followed by that normalized URL. urlopen receives timeout=30. It calls resp.read(5*1024*1024+1), requesting up to that many bytes, and raises ValueError when the returned body exceeds 5*1024*1024 bytes (5 MiB). The shown timeout argument is not proof of an end-to-end deadline.","created_at":"2026-10-01T00:00:00Z","expires_at":null,"id":"25d01906-5307-4bb6-9416-36bdeba43f17","kind":"fact","provenance":{"kind":"import","note":"{\"comparison_run_id\":\"5c5eae20c40a4a26a9915e7ca63ecf50\",\"receipt_sha256\":\"73ba4de90cae13005579526f7c09a6710f3ae04d7d4f9d285f48cdb9b734ed7e\",\"record_id\":\"r03\",\"report_sha256\":\"d10585450dc9f48137e107bd35446198536b4c94fe309f3b5a359df03114d3b1\",\"scenario_clock_is_simulated\":true,\"source_workflow_memory_id\":\"19f89fb7-8d92-4fbe-959c-13df1725d579\",\"source_workflow_task_id\":\"778fb8b7-0a1d-49e5-9a6f-98589ce31410\"}","ref":"public-report-sha256:d10585450dc9f48137e107bd35446198536b4c94fe309f3b5a359df03114d3b1"},"replaced_by_id":null,"replacement_kind":null,"replaces_id":null,"scope":{"id":"6de15ab1-e992-49a6-9be8-fe0cf5c0c676","kind":"project"},"status":"active"},"r04":{"content":"Agent-Reach Web check selects Jina Reader and returns the literal status ok without a network request. This readiness result does not prove that Jina Reader or any target page was retrieved.","created_at":"2026-10-01T00:00:00Z","expires_at":null,"id":"21792005-b38b-4eff-b248-733eca13bd1b","kind":"fact","provenance":{"kind":"import","note":"{\"comparison_run_id\":\"5c5eae20c40a4a26a9915e7ca63ecf50\",\"receipt_sha256\":\"73ba4de90cae13005579526f7c09a6710f3ae04d7d4f9d285f48cdb9b734ed7e\",\"record_id\":\"r04