d. Missing that substring leads to a warn branch.","created_at":"2026-10-01T00:00:00Z","expires_at":null,"id":"54d2013a-6009-4300-b2b9-5013245d9c27","kind":"fact","provenance":{"kind":"import","note":"{\"comparison_run_id\":\"5c5eae20c40a4a26a9915e7ca63ecf50\",\"receipt_sha256\":\"73ba4de90cae13005579526f7c09a6710f3ae04d7d4f9d285f48cdb9b734ed7e\",\"record_id\":\"r06\",\"report_sha256\":\"d10585450dc9f48137e107bd35446198536b4c94fe309f3b5a359df03114d3b1\",\"scenario_clock_is_simulated\":true,\"source_workflow_memory_id\":\"19f89fb7-8d92-4fbe-959c-13df1725d579\",\"source_workflow_task_id\":\"778fb8b7-0a1d-49e5-9a6f-98589ce31410\"}","ref":"public-report-sha256:d10585450dc9f48137e107bd35446198536b4c94fe309f3b5a359df03114d3b1"},"replaced_by_id":null,"replacement_kind":null,"replaces_id":null,"scope":{"id":"6de15ab1-e992-49a6-9be8-fe0cf5c0c676","kind":"project"},"status":"active"},"r07":{"content":"Agent-Reach YouTube transcribe defaults provider to auto and allow_provider_fallback to False and passes both to the lazily imported agent_reach.transcribe.transcribe helper. That helper's implementation was not inspected, so its actual transcription and fallback behavior remain unknown.","created_at":"2026-10-01T00:00:00Z","expires_at":null,"id":"80832613-92dd-41d8-a310-1e4d63f7f377","kind":"fact","provenance":{"kind":"import","note":"{\"comparison_run_id\":\"5c5eae20c40a4a26a9915e7ca63ecf50\",\"receipt_sha256\":\"73ba4de90cae13005579526f7c09a6710f3ae04d7d4f9d285f48cdb9b734ed7e\",\"record_id\":\"r07\",\"report_sha256\":\"d10585450dc9f48137e107bd35446198536b4c94fe309f3b5a359df03114d3b1\",\"scenario_clock_is_simulated\":true,\"source_workflow_memory_id\":\"19f89fb7-8d92-4fbe-959c-13df1725d579\",\"source_workflow_task_id\":\"778fb8b7-0a1d-49e5-9a6f-98589ce31410\"}","ref":"public-report-sha256:d10585450dc9f48137e107bd35446198536b4c94fe309f3b5a359df03114d3b1"},"replaced_by_id":null,"replacement_kind":null,"replaces_id":null,"scope":{"id":"6de15ab1-e992-49a6-9be8-fe0cf5c0c676","kind"